  "solution": "Đặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (loại)</mtext></mrow><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó tổng giá trị lớn nhất và nhỏ nhất là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
